# Evaitec Logo - Minimalist & Sophisticated Refinement

I've refined the popular bio-cybernetic concept into 3 new, ultra-minimalist and sophisticated (**soty**) variations. These focus on pure 3D forms, high-end materials, and cleaner lines.

## Minimalist & Sophisticated Variations (V13 - V15)

````carousel
![Minimalist Glass V13](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e891f36b-1a20-4d85-8b8c-7f3a65cecc50/evaitec_logo_v13_minimalist_glass_1774316603218.png)
**Variation 13: Minimalist Glass**
A pure, geometry-focused infinity loop. Left side is a single green vine-line, right side is a blue fiber-optic circuit. Features a frosted glass microchip.
<!-- slide -->
![Sleek Tech-Vine V14](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e891f36b-1a20-4d85-8b8c-7f3a65cecc50/evaitec_logo_v14_sleek_tech_vine_1774316617640.png)
**Variation 14: Sleek Tech-Vine**
An abstract black technical wire transforming into a thin emerald vine. Very sleek and professional.
<!-- slide -->
![Abstract Bio-Digital V15](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e891f36b-1a20-4d85-8b8c-7f3a65cecc50/evaitec_logo_v15_abstract_icon_1774316633319.png)
**Variation 15: Abstract Bio-Digital**
A high-end 3D symbol focused on pure glossy curves and minimalist circuit trails. The most "soty" and abstract version.
````

## Refinement Highlights
- **Less is More**: Reduced the number of leaves and simplified circuit patterns.
- **Sophisticated Materials**: Used frosted glass, matte finishes, and subtle bioluminescent glows.
- **Pure Symbol**: Maintained the nature-tech hybrid concept in its most distilled form.

New variations are available in your project folder:
